            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-japandi-moss/20 text-japandi-moss flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">&check;</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Flexible Valplast Partials:</strong> Metal-free nylon that flexes comfortably and matches natural gum tone.
