        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
          Easily accessible for patients across Hennur Bande, Horamavu Agara Road, Kalyan Nagar, HRBR Layout, Banaswadi, Kammanahalli, Babusapalya, and North Bengaluru. House of Dental offers senior-friendly accessibility, gentle clinical care, and convenient EMI options on all prosthodontic services.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQs Section -->
